# Verification required

Before claiming success:

- **Gate:** IDENTIFY proof command → RUN fresh → READ full output → VERIFY → then claim ([debug/reference.md](../../ai-skills/debug/reference.md) § Close-out verification gate)
- state expected outcome after the patch
- run or describe verification (test, repro, lint) for the affected flow
- note what was **not** run and why
- list regression risks for adjacent behavior
- if call targets changed this turn: grep old symbols per [`patching/callee-redirect-cleanup.mdc`](../patching/callee-redirect-cleanup.mdc) before claiming done

Forbidden without fresh run: "should work", "looks correct", "done", "perfect".

If verification cannot run, say so explicitly — do not imply the fix is proven.
